    {
      "source": "Use a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a> to iterate over entries in the hash at <code>key</code>.",
